        "page": 2,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p2_s3"
      },
      "text": "What follows is a brief description of what the sample of the Shamoon malware does and a description and results of researchers’ file system recovery efforts.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
